    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "For criteria.type DATE, the documented maximum is three partition fields total, including the required archival date field; at most two other fields can be added. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:04c1229672265e0b6780597ebaeb1e4f9d933c31522635954112dd080a7ceeb5",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For criteria.type CUSTOM, the documented maximum is two partition fields total. The DATE three-field allowance is conditional on DATE criteria, not a general allowance for every archive. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:76ef78f525955be83579e444fca734b83e3b4c136a96d37310e92fbad6fb539b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An Online Archive must have at least one partition field; the documented maxima are not a requirement to populate every available field slot. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
